          "height": 459792,
          "normalized_box": [
            0.124,
            0.692,
            0.208,
            0.067
          ],
          "text": "▸ 存量+R：由2971提升至3500户。\n▸ 提值30元以上FTTR/金融同装率：由41%提升至48%。"
        },
        {
          "name": "table-value-item-2-title",
          "kind": "editable_text",
