          "left": 853418,
          "top": 5325355,
          "width": 548626,
          "height": 432342,
          "normalized_box": [
            0.07,
            0.776,
            0.045,
            0.063
          ],
          "text": "提值规模\n从哪来？"
        },
        {
          "name": "table-value-item-2-body",
          "kind": "editable_text",
          "parent": null,
          "left": 1511770,
          "top": 5304768,
          "width": 2535872,
          "height": 459792,
          "normalized_box": [
            0.124,
            0.773,
            0.208,
            0.067
          ],
          "text": "四类客群策略优化：①超高端：重推系弱提值。②老旧套餐：深挖需求，适配专属权益。③不限量：提移宽选套感知。④21：细分消费促融合。"
        },
        {
          "name": "table-value-item-3-title",
          "kind": "editable_text",
          "parent": null,
          "left": 853418,
          "top": 5881224,
          "width": 548626,
          "height": 439204,
          "normalized_box": [
            0.07,
            0.857,
            0.045,
            0.064
          ],
          "text": "营销组织"
        },
        {
          "name": "table-value-item-3-body",
          "kind": "editable_text",
          "parent": null,
          "left": 1511770,
          "top": 5860636,
          "width": 2535872,
          "height": 466654,
          "normalized_box": [
            0.124,
            0.854,
            0.208,
            0.068
          ],
          "text": "转变策略：①盯规模向盯提值金额转变。②营销模式由传统外呼转向面客。③主推产品由轻合约转向重合约。④升规模转向控升降比。"
        },
